### Problem Description

Tests for the Filebeat's `elasticsearch` slowlog module started failing after updating to Elasticsearch 8.7.0 and later.

You can see the failure details in this build https://beats-ci.elastic.co/blue/organizations/jenkins/Beats%2Fbeats/detail/PR-34589/24/pipeline/

Downgrading to 8.6.3-7488d6a9-SNAPSHOT fixes the test.

